    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "delphisci dataset-resolvability assessor (Grok 4.7)";
    prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/usesModel> <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7-high-fast>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7-high-fast> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LanguageModel>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7";
    dc:identifier "grok-4.7-high-fast".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2015-girardia-05--grok> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grok 4.7 on levin-2015-girardia-05: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.38";
    dc:description "Anterior mitotic pattern is measurable, and PlanMine documents planarian stem-cell markers in general. It does not contain this octanol-treated spatial series. The further conclusion that gap-junction-sensitive patterning organizes the stem cells needs paired shape and count data that are not public.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Count phospho-histone H3-positive cells in the anterior sixth and compare their spatial distribution across induced head classes and wild-type reference species. A shift of the induced animals toward the reference species' pattern would support co-transformation; no class-linked shift would refute it.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Head shape and neoblast distribution can share downstream causes, so a matching distribution does not show that the same patterning process organizes both.", "The paper's anterior mitotic counts and positions are not deposited.";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasConfidence> "0.64"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasScore> "0.38"^^xsd:double;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/hasVerdict> "needs-new-data".
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/levin-2015-girardia-05--grok--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Analysis feasibility of levin-2015-girardia-05 by Grok 4.7: 0.3";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-analysis-feasibility>;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast>;
